# 🛍️ Fashion Retail Analytics Dashboard

Interactive data analytics dashboard built with Python, Gradio and Plotly to explore retail sales performance, pricing strategy, and customer behavior.

---

## 📊 Project Overview

This project is an interactive dashboard designed to analyze a fashion retail dataset.  
It allows users to filter data by category, brand, and date range to explore key business metrics in real time.

The goal is to simulate a **business intelligence tool** for retail decision-making.

---

## 🚀 Features

- Real-time KPI tracking (sales, returns, discounts, ratings)
- Interactive filtering by category and brand
- Price vs discount analysis
- Customer rating insights
- Return reasons breakdown
- Stock vs rating relationship
- Monthly sales trend visualization
- Export filtered dataset as CSV report

---

## 🧰 Tech Stack

- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Plotly
- Gradio
- KaggleHub

